{
  "__html": "\n    <div><p class=\"api-kicker\"><span></span> REIZO · 面向开发者</p><h1>把多模型能力，<br><span>接入你的产品。</span></h1><p class=\"api-lede\">从文本推理，到图像与视频创作。<br>在一处选择模型、了解价格，按实际用量付费。</p>\n      <div class=\"api-actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"/account/keys\">获取 API 密钥 <span>↗</span></a><a class=\"api-secondary\" href=\"#catalog\">查看模型与价格 <span>↓</span></a></div>\n      <a class=\"api-doc-link\" href=\"/docs\">已有项目？查看开发接入指引 ↗</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"api-map\" aria-label=\"通过 REIZO API 连接文本、图像和视频模型的示意图\">\n      <div class=\"map-caption\"><span>你的下一次调用</span><code>POST /v1/…</code></div>\n      <div class=\"map-origin\"><span class=\"origin-brackets\">{ }</span><div><strong>你的产品</strong><small>应用 · 服务 · 工作流</small></div></div>\n      <div class=\"map-connector\"><span></span><code>Authorization: Bearer …</code></div>\n      <div class=\"map-hub\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/reizo-mark.png\" alt=\"\"><strong>REIZO API</strong><span>按需调用</span></div>\n      <div class=\"map-branches\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n      <div class=\"map-destinations\"><div><span>文本与推理</span><div><img src=\"/reizo/assets/openai.svg\" alt=\"OpenAI\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/anthropic.svg\" alt=\"Anthropic\"></div></div><div><span>图像创作</span><div><img src=\"/reizo/assets/gemini.svg\" alt=\"Gemini\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/openai.svg\" alt=\"OpenAI\"></div></div><div><span>视频生成</span><div><img src=\"/reizo/assets/minimax.svg\" alt=\"MiniMax\"><img src=\"/reizo/assets/qwen.svg\" alt=\"通义万相\"></div></div></div>\n      <p class=\"map-footnote\">不同能力使用对应接口 · 具体支持范围以文档为准</p>\n    </div>\n  "
}
